```console
$ scherzo-cloud connection linear authorization show --help
Show an authorization session

Usage: scherzo-cloud connection linear authorization show [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION> <SESSION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <SESSION>       Linear authorization session ID

Options:
      --json                           Emit newline-delimited JSON events
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

```
